+## Scheduled notifications
+
+| Method | Path | Auth | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| GET | /v1/me/notification-preferences | user | `{timezone, quiet_hours: {start, end} \| null}`; default `{"timezone":"UTC","quiet_hours":null}` |
+| PUT | /v1/me/notification-preferences | user | same shape; IANA zone, `HH:MM` bounds |
+| POST | /v1/notifications | user | `{channel, subject?, body, send_at}`, optional `Idempotency-Key` header → 201 (200 on replay, 409 `idempotency_key_reused`) |
+| GET | /v1/notifications/{id} | owner | others get 404 |
+| POST | /v1/admin/notifications/dispatch | admin | run one dispatch pass → `{sent, retried, failed, deferred}` |
+
+Due notifications are delivered by a dispatch pass (every 30 s in the server,
+or on demand). Nothing is delivered during the recipient's quiet hours.
+Failed deliveries are retried after 1 and 2 minutes; after 3 failed attempts
+the notification is `failed`.
